OpenAgent Portal
================

OpenAgent Portal is based on pi-agent and pi-web.

This project is NOT an official release of either upstream project, and the upstream
authors do not endorse it. It adds, around their code, the files under `tigerai/` and a
small number of marked call sites (`TG-HOOK`) in otherwise unmodified upstream files.

